<Base title="Privacy & Data Use" description="GEAR Moto Foundation development-stage website privacy notice for general inquiries, third-party services and sensitive records.">
<section class="inner-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Respect Every Rider</div><h1>PRIVACY &amp;<br/><span class="accent">DATA USE.</span></h1><p class="lede" style="color:#e5e8eb">Your privacy matters while we build responsible ways to serve the riding community.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap prose">
<div class="program-callout"><strong>Development-stage notice · October 13, 2026.</strong> This describes the present website's intended data flows; final operational privacy and retention procedures require further approval. It is not a representation that unverified systems are already live.</div>
<h2>What the Website Requests</h2><p>The general contact form requests a name, email, topic and message, with an optional phone number. Once configured, the site's Cloudflare contact function is designed to transmit submitted information to the appropriate foundation mailbox using a third-party email service. Direct email links open your own mail application.</p>
<h2>Other Services</h2><p>Web hosting and security services may process routine technical connection information. The website can also load external fonts and a Google Calendar embedded events view; those services have their own privacy practices. Exact operational setup must be checked against the production deployment.</p>
<h2>Do Not Send Sensitive Information</h2><p>Do not submit accident reports, Social Security numbers, medical records, insurance statements, account numbers, payment cards or hardship application documents via this form or ordinary email. Secure intake for assistance and Rider Relief is <strong>not open</strong>.</p>
<h2>Use and Retention</h2><p>General inquiry information is intended to help respond to requests and manage related communications. An approved retention schedule, access rules, vendor arrangements and request-handling process are still being finalized. We do not claim a specific deletion deadline that has not yet been implemented.</p>
<h2>Questions About Information</h2><p>Contact <a href="mailto:info@gearmotofoundation.org?subject=GEAR%20Privacy%20Inquiry">info@gearmotofoundation.org</a> with privacy questions or requests about information you supplied. Do not include sensitive attachments in your initial inquiry. This notice will be updated as approved operations become available.</p>
<div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-red" href="/contact/">Contact GEAR ↗</a><a class="btn btn-outline-dark" href="/governance/">Governance ↗</a></div>
</div></section>
</Base>
